{
  "_note": [
    "The shipped grammar dictionary: selector kinds beyond plural and ordinal, with the key",
    "set each target language needs. The gender sets are CLDR's grammaticalFeatures.json",
    "(the targets-nominal entries, the nominal gender values in upper case, 'other' added,",
    "a locale with no gender listed as 'other' only). CLDR publishes nothing about article",
    "forms; the article sets, the hints and the sample nouns are editorial. Sample nouns are",
    "shipped only for languages a native reader has checked. A language not listed under a",
    "kind is unknown to the dictionary and its selects are walked as the source wrote them.",
    "",
    "Keys are a CLDR locale key. Lookup runs down the same chain as the plural tables: the",
    "whole tag, then language and script, then the language, so an entry under 'de' covers",
    "'de-AT'. A project's developer file respells keys and replaces sets; this file is never",
    "edited for a project."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "cldr": "48",
